Description: StarlingX Openstack application ansible playbooks
 Application-owned ansible playbooks for the StarlingX Openstack FluxCD
 application. Currently ships backup/restore playbooks; reserved for
 additional ansible-driven application features (upgrade, health-check,
 etc.) in future releases.
